in Berlin, Germany for describing a piece of fried chopped pork meat 
(mixed with crushed buns and a bit of egg). 

http://www.fax4net.de/staev/bulett.html 

And a famous and popular hippo in the Berlin Zoo, which lived in the  
years after WWII, had this name, too. Berliners have a weird sense of 
humour, you know. 

But according to other sources, this beast is supposed to be a land 
shark. 


